# LLVM SURFACE — Product-Locked State of `oodac emit-llvm`

File: openOODA/audit/llvm_surface.oot
THIS FILE IS GENERATED — DO NOT EDIT. Refresh by running `ooda/bin/ooda run scripts/llvm_surface_refresh.oo` after the locks in §3 are updated. Source of truth is `ooda/` + locks, not board text.

This door is the single source of truth for what the product LLVM emit (`oodac emit-llvm <file> > foo.ll` then `clang -O0/-O2 -I runtime foo.ll runtime/chs_rt.c -o foo.bin`) actually proves on disk. SHIPPED.oot §2 cites it.

