|26 | SSA pipeline is NOT wired into product path (CRITICAL) | `oodac/cli_emit_llvm.oo:117` | FAIL   | Product `oodac --backend llvm` calls `llvm_emit_stream_full` directly, bypassing the entire `std/llvm_codegen/{compiler_driver,ssa_*,llvm_ir_emitter,llvm_text_emitter,block_scheduler,phi_resolver}` pipeline. The SSA library is used only by `x86_ssa_compile.oo` and test scripts. Every claim in SHIPPED.oot about LLVM SSA/optimizer/dominators/mem2reg is non-functional. |
