|29 | LLVM text emitter drops 17 of 24 opcodes | `std/llvm_codegen/llvm_text_emitter.oo:48-65` | FAIL   | `llvm_format_inst` handles only add/sub/mul/const/ret/br/phi. The other 17 opcodes (load/store/alloca/cond_br/fadd/.../call) return `"; nop"`. Even if SSA was built correctly, the text emitter would silently drop most instructions. |
|30 | llvm_emit_simd.oo is orphaned | `oodac/llvm_emit_simd.oo:242` | FAIL   | No call from `llvm_emit_binop.oo`, `llvm_emit_expr.oo`, or `llvm_emit_ty.oo`. SIMD type codegen doesn't reach the IR stream. |
