|32 | llvm_emit_match_expr only supports String-Result | `oodac/llvm_emit_match_expr_arc.oo:12-30` | FAIL   | `llvm_mex_is_str_result` only accepts `%OoResS` / `%OoResV` and `Result[String, _]`. Int/Bool/Float/struct `match expr` rejected at `llvm_emit_match_expr.oo:152-158`. |
