|37 | P4.31 quick-start: in-process linker is wired but not imported | `oodac/cli_build_targets.oo:128` | FAIL   | `std/llvm_codegen/llvm_native_bin.oo:109-181` is a complete `native_assemble_obj`/`native_link_binary`/`native_compile_and_link` driver, but **no oodac file imports it** (grep `native_assemble_obj\|native_link_binary` returns no oodac caller). Wire: add `import "std/llvm_codegen/llvm_native_bin.oo";` to `cli_build_targets.oo` and replace L128 shell-out. |

Total: 2 PASS, 8 STUB, 8 FAIL.

